From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 23:36:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] clk: mediatek: Add MT6789 multimedia subsystem clock drivers

Add the remaining four MediaTek MT6789 multimedia subsystem clock gate
drivers covering all 57 gates across 8 hardware blocks, verified directly
against stock Advan X1 (MT6789) clk-mt6789-{mmsys,cam,img,vcodec}.ko:

- clk-mt6789-mdp.c: mdpsys (16 gates)
- clk-mt6789-cam.c: camsys_main (11), camsys_rawa (3), camsys_rawb (3)
- clk-mt6789-img.c: imgsys1 (4), ipesys (8)
- clk-mt6789-vcodec.c: vdecsys (8), vencsys (4)

Gates inside KEEP_DEFAULT_OFF multimedia power domains (CAM, ISP, IPE,
VDEC, VENC) carry CLK_IGNORE_UNUSED so clk_disable_unused() does not
access unpowered subsystem CG registers during boot before consumers
power on their parent genpd.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
---
 drivers/clk/mediatek/Makefile            |   4 +-
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-cam.c    |  96 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-img.c    |  77 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-mdp.c    |  75 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-vcodec.c |  95 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 346 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-cam.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-img.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-mdp.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6789-vcodec.c

